{"quest":"Alfred Grimhand's Barcrawl","character":"Barbarian guard","text":"Are you, now? Free up some space so you can carry something, and we'll see how barbarian you really are.","uri":"c91c6d5222efa3d012af0f259a4b0a5e.mp3"}
{"quest":"Alfred Grimhand's Barcrawl","character":"Barbarian guard","text":"Barbarians only. Are you a barbarian? You don't look like one.","uri":"97fefa14baa880c906f5b3ebe436f371.mp3"}
{"quest":"Alfred Grimhand's Barcrawl","character":"Barbarian guard","text":"Do I look like a bank to you?","uri":"90302c11a9931aaf9eaee983292c7a6e.mp3"}
{"quest":"Alfred Grimhand's Barcrawl","character":"Barbarian guard","text":"I have the perfect challenge for you... The Alfred Grimhand Barcrawl! First completed by Alfred Grimhand.","uri":"4ca07efe2c1de6656cf18d9ef613f06b.mp3"}
{"quest":"Alfred Grimhand's Barcrawl","character":"Barbarian guard","text":"If you're a barbarian you need to be able to drink like one. We barbarians like a good drink.","uri":"7cb41e2e482cde3e6c2a66fecca11f6e.mp3"}
{"quest":"Alfred Grimhand's Barcrawl","character":"Barbarian guard","text":"It’s all part of drinking like a barbarian! Okay, you will now smash your vials as you drink your potions.","uri":"46d1fe1cea07d0536c6071da6674fc4a.mp3"}
{"quest":"Alfred Grimhand's Barcrawl","character":"Barbarian guard","text":"Oi, whaddya want?","uri":"53505ab1ad2a054364188d9c1b8705c7.mp3"}
{"quest":"Alfred Grimhand's Barcrawl","character":"Barbarian guard","text":"Since you drink like a barbarian, I can show you how to smash your vials when you finish them. Do you want to do that?","uri":"89fae4259f0b1b99133f38446063ebb1.mp3"}
{"quest":"Alfred Grimhand's Barcrawl","character":"Barbarian guard","text":"So, how's the Barcrawl coming along?","uri":"77577d998dafbb185ed9a1b7f795443b.mp3"}
{"quest":"Alfred Grimhand's Barcrawl","character":"Barbarian guard","text":"Take that card to each of the bars named on it. The bartenders will know what it means. We're kinda well known.","uri":"777223be0392a97968be40c7b9df09c5.mp3"}
{"quest":"Alfred Grimhand's Barcrawl","character":"Barbarian guard","text":"They'll give you their strongest drink and sign your card. When you've done all that, we'll be happy to let you in.","uri":"6b78562d457f547cfe6e370df9ec3698.mp3"}
{"quest":"Alfred Grimhand's Barcrawl","character":"Barbarian guard","text":"Well come back when you have, you lightweight.","uri":"48b3258863c5d0ae129e063d15c5fb19.mp3"}
{"quest":"Alfred Grimhand's Barcrawl","character":"Barbarian guard","text":"What are you like? You're gonna have to start all over now.","uri":"454fa6a360b01795ac7993ff56bd919e.mp3"}
{"quest":"Alfred Grimhand's Barcrawl","character":"Barbarian guard","text":"Yep that seems fine, you can come in now. I never learned to read, but you look like you've drunk plenty. Also, one more thing...","uri":"a98541d0a9282a301de6f6f12f9bb677.mp3"}
{"quest":"Alfred Grimhand's Barcrawl","character":"Barbarian guard","text":"You need to take it with you when you're going on a barcrawl.","uri":"d67cec82a412b240bb1675257ab251b6.mp3"}
